## Invariants

- Do NOT change `DEFAULT_SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD` or any matcher logic (0502 precedent)
- Do NOT re-run experiments; read only the committed `matching_sensitivity.csv`
- The `\input` line for the new macros goes in the preamble, not mid-document
- All script outputs regenerate on every build run (Makefile rule re-runs when
  script or reference CSV changes) — required for a `\input`-ed macros file (see
  `.claude/rules/writing.md` "LaTeX macro includes (tectonic)")
- `name_clean` column must be present in reference CSV; use `load_plants_csv()`
  which normalises headers

